WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:04.415
Sign in to Propellus Agent Portal using your invitation email link.

00:00:05.562 --> 00:00:10.008
Welcome to the Propellus Agent Portal. Click Dashboard for an instant overview

00:00:10.008 --> 00:00:14.453
of your entire order pipeline and performance. From here, apply custom filters

00:00:14.453 --> 00:00:18.899
to manage active orders and gain real-time visibility into your top destinations

00:00:18.899 --> 00:00:20.010
and client nationalities

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:25.488
From here, click the New order button to create visa application order

00:00:25.488 --> 00:00:26.439
on traveller's behalf.

00:00:28.116 --> 00:00:32.119
Once the window pops up, simply select the destination and click Start

00:00:32.119 --> 00:00:36.122
Visa Assistant to let our AI tool guide you through the traveler's

00:00:36.122 --> 00:00:36.789
application step-by-step.

00:00:38.488 --> 00:00:42.824
Next, head over to Order Fulfilment, then select any application from the

00:00:42.824 --> 00:00:47.159
list to open its full details—where you can update statuses, assign order

00:00:47.159 --> 00:00:48.966
to suppliers, and track progress.

00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:54.596
Inside Order Fulfillment, you can also click New Order right here to

00:00:54.596 --> 00:00:58.553
process a fresh visa application on your traveler's behalf—just like you can

00:00:58.553 --> 00:00:59.872
from the main Dashboard.

00:01:01.697 --> 00:01:07.193
Next, navigate to Suppliers from the side menu. Click Browse Supplier Directory

00:01:07.193 --> 00:01:12.690
to explore verified visa suppliers, connect products, and manage pricing and availability.

00:01:14.417 --> 00:01:19.409
Inside the directory, compare suppliers based on destinations and approval rates. Then,

00:01:19.409 --> 00:01:24.401
click Connect under your chosen partner—like Shapla Visa Services—to initiate a partnership

00:01:24.401 --> 00:01:26.897
and route your processing to them.

00:01:28.351 --> 00:01:32.676
select your destinations, enter your estimated monthly volume, and click Send Request

00:01:32.676 --> 00:01:34.478
to submit your partnership proposal.

00:01:36.163 --> 00:01:39.726
Next, click Visa Configuration on the left menu to set up and

00:01:39.726 --> 00:01:41.211
manage your visa service offerings.

00:01:42.881 --> 00:01:48.542
Inside Visa Configuration, click Import from Template to quickly load pre-configured visa

00:01:48.542 --> 00:01:49.014
products.

00:01:50.692 --> 00:01:54.905
Once the catalog opens, simply click Import next to the Thailand Tourist

00:01:54.905 --> 00:01:58.064
Visa to pull it straight into your active products.

00:01:59.869 --> 00:02:03.923
Simply select the Queen Travel store checkbox and hit Import to 1

00:02:03.923 --> 00:02:06.288
store to finalize adding the visa product.

00:02:07.907 --> 00:02:11.822
Next, click Store Configuration to manage your storefront settings and branding. If

00:02:11.822 --> 00:02:15.737
you want to build a new storefront, simply click + New storefront

00:02:15.737 --> 00:02:16.390
right here.

00:02:18.068 --> 00:02:22.239
Enter your store name and subdomain, then click Create storefront to finalize

00:02:22.239 --> 00:02:22.934
your setup.

00:02:24.652 --> 00:02:28.932
Here, you can fully customize your storefront. Add your business details under

00:02:28.932 --> 00:02:33.212
Storefront Identity, match your site colors in Brand & Theme, set your

00:02:33.212 --> 00:02:37.493
target country, language, and currency under Operating Country, and configure online or

00:02:37.493 --> 00:02:41.416
offline options in Payment Gateway to choose how you collect payments.

00:02:43.042 --> 00:02:47.250
All your changes will update live in the right-hand preview panel. Once

00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:51.458
you're happy with how it looks, just hit Publish changes—and your storefront

00:02:51.458 --> 00:02:52.159
is ready!

00:02:53.905 --> 00:02:57.825
Next, click Messaging on the left menu to access your communication tools

00:02:57.825 --> 00:03:01.745
and manage automated emails. If you want to customize an existing template,

00:03:01.745 --> 00:03:04.358
simply click the Edit icon next to it.

00:03:05.934 --> 00:03:09.739
And if you want to create a completely new email template, simply

00:03:09.739 --> 00:03:11.958
click the + Create button right here.

00:03:13.616 --> 00:03:17.382
Fill in your email details here, and as you type, you'll see

00:03:17.382 --> 00:03:21.147
a live preview on the right. Once everything looks good, simply click

00:03:21.147 --> 00:03:22.716
Create template to save it.

00:03:24.467 --> 00:03:27.867
Now, head over to Promotions to set up discounts, coupons, and marketing

00:03:27.867 --> 00:03:29.000
campaigns for your store.

00:03:30.737 --> 00:03:35.537
From here, click + New Campaign to start creating your first promotion

00:03:35.537 --> 00:03:35.937
campaign.

00:03:37.601 --> 00:03:41.835
Enter your campaign details here—like the campaign name, start date, and end

00:03:41.835 --> 00:03:46.070
date. On the right, you can see a live summary of everything

00:03:46.070 --> 00:03:48.540
you've added to finalize your campaign setup.

00:03:50.235 --> 00:03:54.143
Now, let's head over to the Payments tab to manage your payout

00:03:54.143 --> 00:03:58.050
and gateway options. you will land on overview tab from where you

00:03:58.050 --> 00:04:01.958
can track your current plan, revenue, visas processed during this cycle, and

00:04:01.958 --> 00:04:03.260
your cycle end date.

00:04:04.929 --> 00:04:09.776
Click the Usage & Billing tab to view your detailed billing metrics,

00:04:09.776 --> 00:04:13.411
track daily usage, and analyze your per-visa revenue breakdown.

00:04:15.155 --> 00:04:20.318
Next, click the Pricing & Plan tab to view your pricing structure,

00:04:20.318 --> 00:04:23.760
active discounts, volume tiers, and available add-on extensions.

00:04:25.462 --> 00:04:29.651
Finally, click the Statements tab to access past billing cycles, review invoices,

00:04:29.651 --> 00:04:32.094
and track your debit and payout logs.

00:04:33.738 --> 00:04:38.206
Finally, click your profile icon in the top-right corner to manage your

00:04:38.206 --> 00:04:42.301
account settings—and that's it! Your Propellus Agent Portal setup is complete.

00:04:44.091 --> 00:04:47.926
That concludes our guided tour! Click Visit Propellus to explore more features

00:04:47.926 --> 00:04:50.801
and learn how our platform can scale your business.
